&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver complex change and transformation programmes across the General Insurance sector, using AI-enabled approaches where appropriate to improve efficiency, insight, and delivery quality.&lt;/li&gt;
