&lt;li&gt;Engage senior client stakeholders, coordinate multidisciplinary teams, and ensure successful value delivery, embedding responsible AI practices and appropriate governance throughout delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support business development activities, contributing to client growth and account development, including identifying opportunities where AI can create measurable business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted partnerships with clients, vendors, and internal stakeholders across business and technology domains, encouraging practical adoption of AI-enabled ways of working aligned to client objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
