&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end promotions systems&lt;/strong&gt;, from backend services to user-facing tools used by merchants and internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement scalable backend services, working with technologies such as Kotlin and Python and Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop high-quality &lt;strong&gt;web applications using React&lt;/strong&gt;, focused on usability and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of &lt;strong&gt;large, cross-team initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;, driving them from ideation through planning, alignment, and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product, design, and business stakeholders to shape solutions and ensure successful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate effectively in &lt;strong&gt;ambiguous environments&lt;/strong&gt;, bringing structure, clarity, and momentum to complex problem spaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to improving engineering practices, tooling, and development workflows across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll have strong ownership, work closely with cross-functional teams across Europe and the US, and be part of a &lt;strong&gt;diverse and international team&lt;/strong&gt; that values collaboration and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily usage of AI tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations*&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who is both a strong hands-on engineer and a driver of alignment and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;full-stack engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;, with a solid backend foundation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt; and building product-facing web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Kotlin, Python and or Go &lt;/strong&gt;in production environments is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to &lt;strong&gt;take ownership in ambiguous environments&lt;/strong&gt;, driving initiatives from idea to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading &lt;strong&gt;cross-team projects&lt;/strong&gt;, including planning, stakeholder alignment, and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, with the ability to gather feedback, handle differing perspectives, and align stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with &lt;strong&gt;AI-assisted development tools&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Codex, Claude, agent-based workflows) to improve speed and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;native iOS and/or Android development&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Wolt, this role gives you the opportunity to build products that are &lt;strong&gt;directly used by restaurants and brands to grow their business&lt;/strong&gt;. Promotions are one of the most visible and impactful levers on the platform, and your work will shape how merchants attract customers, drive sales, and optimize their performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work on a mix of &lt;strong&gt;backend systems and user-facing tools&lt;/strong&gt;, owning features end-to-end and seeing your work quickly go live across multiple markets. This is a role where you can &lt;strong&gt;build, ship, and iterate fast&lt;/strong&gt;, while still tackling meaningful challenges around scale, usability, and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a strong sense of &lt;strong&gt;ownership and autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;, where engineers are trusted to drive solutions, influence product decisions, and take ideas from concept to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also be part of a &lt;strong&gt;diverse and supportive team&lt;/strong&gt;, where collaboration, feedback, and continuous learning are part of how we work every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our compensation follows a &lt;strong&gt;total compensation model&lt;/strong&gt;, combining a competitive base salary with DoorDash RSUs.&lt;/p&gt;
