&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you’re interested in playing a crucial role at the intersection of traditional and crypto-capital markets and want to help bring the next trillion dollars of finance on-chain, join us.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior CX Software Engineer is a role for people&amp;nbsp; with prior experience and exposure to distributed computing, Canton Network or our product. These individuals are able to stand in front of a client to provide sound advice without support, and to work effectively on components implementation as&amp;nbsp; one of the team when working with clients on client solutions. They can engage confidently with their senior leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverages design thinking to propose robust client solutions. Works with CQRS and event sourcing. Implement design patterns and architectural principles and can apply them to a solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works across different languages to achieve client outcomes. Implement different testing approaches. Interviews technical candidates. Identify the best approach for a client implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tests for, identifies, and remediates bottlenecks in performance of a client solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learns new features and folds them into client solutions. Contributes to DA Product components with client experiences. Translates delivery pain points into actionable product feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measures and monitors the health of a running system. Handles deployment and fine-tuning of more complex topologies into cloud environments, including load balancers and reverse proxies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years experience in software engineering and able to ship production-ready applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad technical exposure with the ability to ramp up quickly on new frameworks, languages, or cloud platforms depending on project needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in leading the technical execution of feature sets, conducting thorough code reviews, and implementing architectural best practices for a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced working directly with business stakeholders to clarify ambiguous requirements and explain technical concepts in plain language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial services domain knowledge and experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a fast-moving environment with multiple competing priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, pragmatic and adaptable, and able to learn quickly in complex environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Digital Asset, we are committed to compensation structures that reward impact consistently across our global teams. We support our people at every stage of life with comprehensive, family-forward benefits and flexible working models designed to help you do your best work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
